# Edit > Move Group to End moves the active group with the groups only
# it needs (an extension): the bolt's head goes to the end of the
# history with its sketch, or the move is refused, naming the group in
# the way. Undo takes the move back as one step.
load thread/bolt_m8x30.slvs
tw
# Activate the head with its radio button.
twmove 24 160
twdown L 24 160
twup L 24 160
menu Edit|Move Group to End
tw
key z ctrl
tw
dump
